      "id": "claim_83af2386248242d68bc24b8a05544028",
      "statement": "The browser face mounts into the harness shell purely through ctx.slots.inject into named slot maps, where the slot name and the register({ name, id, order|priority }) identity decide visibility and ordering; there is no imperative React mounting. The dashboard (order 20), skill-forge (30), tool-integrations (40), and a2a-management (50) tabs fill conversation.view; the pet (no order) and team-panel (order 110) fill shell.overlay; the Papergames logo/wordmark shadow the brand slots at priority -1; the team (order 5) and background (order 10) entries fill sidebar.footer.action.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/index.ts#L134-L168",
