      "id": "claim_d102843a9ef947639a3410541745e85a",
      "statement": "The capability views and the team-panel slot are registered inside the pet-panel-capabilities child plugin, not the main apply() function, because their inject closures read the mounted Typert namespace services (remote.skillForge, remote.toolIntegrations, remote.a2aConfig, remote.team) which only resolve after Typert $mount and only inside a child context whose inject array lists those sub-namespaces; the main apply() context holds remote but not the mounted sub-namespaces and accessing them throws 'without inject'.",
