      "id": "claim_7d3888750feb45ceb1be727d8d795948",
      "statement": "PetView is a root-scope shell.overlay component that draws five inline-SVG species (cat, dog, rabbit, chick, dragon) that all reuse one shared FACES expression table; a Face selects an EyeKind, MouthKind, blink flag, optional talk/chomp animation, and optional cheeks. No binary sprite assets ship. Its resting action derives from the global useSessions feed (any running session -> busy; any pendingInteraction -> waiting; else idle) and a manual feed/play/sleep action overrides it for 4000ms before reverting.",
