      "id": "claim_db1ad7e3eb534a51a0aa69721b60ee7a",
      "statement": "The Papergames theme override (applyPapergamesTheme) injects a <style data-papergames-theme> through ctx.effect (auto-removed on plugin dispose) and MUST target body, not :root, because the host installs its tokens on body and a :root rule loses to the host's body rule which re-declares the same custom properties. It remaps the --dsw-static-deepseek-* blue ramp (brand #4176e6) onto a coral ramp anchored at #F36864 along with background-glass and base-bg token overrides.",
