      "id": "claim_ef91440703c649f481e8a57999454fbf",
      "statement": "The Team Chamber is a two-piece surface bridged by teamPanelStore: TeamTrigger (sidebar.footer.action, order 5) only calls teamPanelStore.openPanel on click, and TeamView (shell.overlay, order 110) is root-scope, returns null when the store reports closed, and renders a full-screen overlay that closes on outside click. On open it refreshes teams and the a2a config (card name + registered external agents), probes external-agent health, then polls health every 15s while open; member status is derived from that probe (me always online, unknown names show unknown).",
